@startuml
title UC5 - Manage Team - Test Cases

map "TC-UC5-01: View team roster" as TC1 {
  Test Case Number => TC-UC5-01
  Test Case Name => View Pokemon team roster successfully
  Description => Verify player can view their full team with correct stats
  Preconditions => 1. Player is logged in \n 2. Player has 3 Pokemon in team
  Test Case Input => Team: Charmander (Lv.10), Pidgey (Lv.7), Rattata (Lv.5)
  Expected Output => 1. All 3 Pokemon displayed with Name, Level, HP, Type, Moves \n 2. Team order matches current arrangement
  Steps => 1. Access Team Management screen \n 2. System loads player team data \n 3. Verify 3 Pokemon displayed \n 4. Verify Charmander shows Lv.10, Fire type \n 5. Verify Pidgey shows Lv.7, Normal/Flying type \n 6. Verify Rattata shows Lv.5, Normal type \n 7. Verify correct order displayed
  Default Value Preserving => No changes to team data (read-only operation)
}

map "TC-UC5-02: Swap Pokemon positions" as TC2 {
  Test Case Number => TC-UC5-02
  Test Case Name => Swap two Pokemon positions in team
  Description => Verify player can swap the order of two Pokemon in team
  Preconditions => 1. Player is logged in \n 2. Player has at least 2 Pokemon
  Test Case Input => Swap: Position 1 (Charmander) with Position 3 (Rattata)
  Expected Output => 1. Rattata moves to Position 1 \n 2. Charmander moves to Position 3 \n 3. Position 2 (Pidgey) unchanged
  Steps => 1. Access Team Management \n 2. Select Charmander (Position 1) \n 3. Choose Swap Position action \n 4. Select Rattata (Position 3) \n 5. System swaps positions \n 6. Verify new order: Rattata, Pidgey, Charmander \n 7. Verify GameSession updated
  Default Value Preserving => Team composition unchanged, only order modified
}

@enduml
